 306+ 6ED0              PaintMagicCompassAttrs:
 307+ 6ED0                  ; Selección de tabla de attrs según modo (temporal vs lasting).
 308+ 6ED0                  ; MagicCompassPermanent: 0 = ID 36 (magic compass temporal random pickup)
 309+ 6ED0                  ;                        1 = ID 37 (compass lasting, post-cinemática iglesia)
 310+ 6ED0 11 37 6F         LD DE, MagicCompassBaseAttrs
 311+ 6ED3 3A CA 82         LD A, (MagicCompassPermanent)
