 322+ 6EE4 77               LD (HL), A
 323+ 6EE5 13               INC DE
 324+ 6EE6 21 38 58         LD HL, $5800 + (COMPASS_CHARROW + 1) * $20 + COMPASS_COL
 325+ 6EE9 1A               LD A, (DE)
 326+ 6EEA 77               LD (HL), A
 327+ 6EEB 23               INC HL
 328+ 6EEC 13               INC DE
 329+ 6EED 1A               LD A, (DE)
