1567+ 9530 77               LD (HL), A
1568+ 9531
1569+ 9531              .mulHaveGap:
1570+ 9531                  ; --- Cargar side/coord y traducir a pixel (MaiSpawnX/Y) ---
1571+ 9531 3A D0 97         LD A, (MulSlot)
1572+ 9534 5F               LD E, A
1573+ 9535 16 00            LD D, 0
1574+ 9537 21 92 8D         LD HL, MonsterEntryBorder
1575+ 953A 19               ADD HL, DE
1576+ 953B 7E               LD A, (HL)
