1581+ 9544 32 C1 97         LD (MaiGapCoord), A
1582+ 9547 CD 2E 90         CALL MaiPickRandomGap.mprgTranslate ; Escribe MaiSpawnX/Y
1583+ 954A
1584+ 954A                  ; --- Reach: bbox del monster (16w × 21h) overlapea con el pixel del gap.
1585+ 954A                  ; Tolerancia segun side (para no sobre-permitir despawn lejos del gap):
1586+ 954A                  ;   N/S (sides 0,1) - gaps son 4 chars de ancho:
1587+ 954A                  ;     X paralelo = 47 px (bbox 16 + gap 32 - 1)
1588+ 954A                  ;     Y perpendicular = 28 px (bbox 21 + gap 8 - 1)
1589+ 954A                  ;   W/E (sides 2,3) - gaps duales: 3 chars superior, 5 chars inferior:
1590+ 954A                  ;     X perpendicular = 23 px (bbox 16 + gap 8 - 1)
1591+ 954A                  ;     Y paralelo = 60 px (bbox 21 + gap 40 - 1, cubre 5 chars worst-case)
1592+ 954A 3A C0 97         LD A, (MaiGapSide)
1593+ 954D FE 02            CP 2                                        ; MAI_SIDE_W = 2
1594+ 954F 30 1E            JR NC, .mulReachVerticalSide                ; W/E
1595+ 9551
1596+ 9551                  ; --- N/S: X paralelo 47, Y perpendicular 28 ---
1597+ 9551 3A C5 97         LD A, (MaiSpawnX)
