1600+ 9558 90               SUB B
1601+ 9559 C6 17            ADD A, 23
1602+ 955B FE 2F            CP 47
1603+ 955D 30 32            JR NC, .mulNotReached
1604+ 955F 3A C6 97         LD A, (MaiSpawnY)
1605+ 9562 47               LD B, A
