  79+ 98B3 F3               DI
  80+ 98B4 3A 87 8D         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
  81+ 98B7 E6 F8            AND $F8
  82+ 98B9 F6 04            OR 4
  83+ 98BB 32 87 8D         LD (CurrentPaging), A
  84+ 98BE 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
  85+ 98C1 ED 79            OUT (C), A
  86+ 98C3 CD 92 7D         CALL UpdateMusicImpl
  87+ 98C6 3A 87 8D         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
  88+ 98C9 E6 F8            AND $F8
  89+ 98CB 32 87 8D         LD (CurrentPaging), A
  90+ 98CE 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
  91+ 98D1 ED 79            OUT (C), A
  92+ 98D3 FB               EI
  93+ 98D4 C9               RET
