  95+ 98D5              ; --- AY_PlayBellChime: medianoche/iglesia, cold ---
  96+ 98D5              ; D = pan (-1=izq, 0=centro, +1=der). Preservar D atraviesa el thunk porque
  97+ 98D5              ; el patron page-switch no toca DE.
  98+ 98D5              ; SP alterno + DI corto solo en el Impl (mismo patron que AY_UpdateBell).
  99+ 98D5              AY_PlayBellChime:
 100+ 98D5 ED 73 02 99      LD (.apbcSavedSP), SP
 101+ 98D9 31 D6 68         LD SP, PagingAltStackTop
 102+ 98DC 3A 87 8D         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
 103+ 98DF E6 F8            AND $F8
 104+ 98E1 F6 04            OR 4
 105+ 98E3 32 87 8D         LD (CurrentPaging), A
 106+ 98E6 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
 107+ 98E9 ED 79            OUT (C), A
 108+ 98EB F3               DI
 109+ 98EC CD D6 E4         CALL AY_PlayBellChimeImpl
 110+ 98EF FB               EI
 111+ 98F0 3A 87 8D         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
 112+ 98F3 E6 F8            AND $F8
