1948+ A9B7                  ; Attack west: comprobar X-8 en fila superior e inferior → mover +8
1949+ A9B7 D5               PUSH DE
1950+ A9B8 C5               PUSH BC
1951+ A9B9 DD 7E 03         LD A, (IX+ENT_POSX)
1952+ A9BC D6 08            SUB 8
