1972+ A9E3                  ; Attack east: comprobar X+23 en fila superior E inferior → mover -8
1973+ A9E3              .pushBackEast:
1974+ A9E3 D5               PUSH DE
1975+ A9E4 C5               PUSH BC
1976+ A9E5 DD 7E 03         LD A, (IX+ENT_POSX)
