2008+ AA1D C5               PUSH BC
2009+ AA1E D5               PUSH DE
2010+ AA1F 21 DF F9         LD HL, SFX_Attack
2011+ AA22 CD 69 F9         CALL PlaySFX
2012+ AA25 D1               POP DE
2013+ AA26 C1               POP BC
2014+ AA27              .newAnimNoSfx:
