2614+ AD38 CB 5F            BIT 3, A
2615+ AD3A 28 07            JR Z, .paRndDown
2616+ AD3C 3A 5A 8D         LD A, (CurrentEnemySpeed)
2617+ AD3F ED 44            NEG
2618+ AD41 18 03            JR .paRndSetDY
