4835+ B9A2 3E 01            LD A, 1
4836+ B9A4 32 B5 B9         LD (.spawnIgnoreZone), A
4837+ B9A7 3E 04            LD A, 4
4838+ B9A9 32 B4 B9         LD (.spawnTries), A
4839+ B9AC C3 69 B8         JP .spawnRetry
