5719+ BE6E 4C               DEFB SPRID_MONSTER_0
5720+ BE6F 54               DEFB SPRID_MONSTER_1
5721+ BE70 5C               DEFB SPRID_MONSTER_2
5722+ BE71              MonsterColorTable:
5723+ BE71 44               DEFB $44                            ; Zombi: verde
5724+ BE72 46               DEFB $46                            ; Skeleton: amarillo
5725+ BE73 45               DEFB $45                            ; Ghost: cyan
