7155+ C6E2              ; --- CheckDeathTouchPlayer: AABB completo 24x24 vs player (no margen) ---
7156+ C6E2              ; Si overlap: PlayerHealth=0, erase sprite, despawn.
7157+ C6E2              CheckDeathTouchPlayer:
