7463+ C8B3 CD 18 C9         CALL .bfsIsVisited
7464+ C8B6 C0               RET NZ
7465+ C8B7                  ; Footprint 3x3 libre?
7466+ C8B7 CD 47 C9         CALL .bfsCanFit
7467+ C8BA C0               RET NZ
