7490+ C8DC 23               INC HL
7491+ C8DD 22 6D 5F         LD (DBfsQTail), HL
7492+ C8E0                  ; --- Score: max depth tie-break min manhattan ---
7493+ C8E0                  ; manhattan = |tryCx - playerCx| + |tryCy - playerCy|
7494+ C8E0 3A 78 5F         LD A, (DBfsTryCx)
7495+ C8E3 57               LD D, A
