 452+ E58B                  ; --- Obtener room index de MapTable[Y*16+X] ---
 453+ E58B 3A 0E 83         LD A, (CurrentScreenY)
 454+ E58E 6F               LD L, A
 455+ E58F 26 00            LD H, 0
