 174+ EFF4 32 BF 82         LD (PreviousObjectiveDistance), A   ; brujula: primer cruce -> blanco
 175+ EFF7 CD F0 6D         CALL CancelMagicCompass             ; magic compass normal: cancela al saltar hito
 176+ EFFA CD 20 6E         CALL RefreshMagicCompassForNewObjective ; lasting compass: recompute path al nuevo goal
 177+ EFFD C9               RET
