 704+ F233              .dcMagicTemp:
 705+ F233 3A C1 5F         LD A, (MagicCompassPathDir)         ; bit 7 ya 0 (PathDir 0..3)
 706+ F236 47               LD B, A
 707+ F237 3A CC 5F         LD A, (LastMagicCompassDrawn)
 708+ F23A B8               CP B
