 195+ FA45              ; --- SFX_CountdownTick: bip ~700ms para "3" y "2" del countdown ---
 196+ FA45              ; Pitch 102 = ~1047 Hz. Calibrado para octava precisa con pitch 50 (ratio 1.992).
 197+ FA45              ; (PlaySFX tiene ~78T de overhead por ciclo ademas de 32*pitch -> ratio puro
 198+ FA45              ; 100/50 quedaria desafinado ~30 cents. Compensado a 102 da ~7 cents.)
 199+ FA45              SFX_CountdownTick:
 200+ FA45 FA 66 00 00      DEFB 250, 102, 0, 0         ; ~239ms
 201+ FA49 FA 66 00 00      DEFB 250, 102, 0, 0         ; ~478ms
 202+ FA4D E6 66 00 00      DEFB 230, 102, 0, 0         ; ~219ms (total ~718ms)
 203+ FA51 00               DEFB 0
 204+ FA52
 205+ FA52              ; --- SFX_CountdownGo: octava arriba del Tick, ~1s ---
 206+ FA52              ; Pitch 50 = ~2086 Hz. Ratio period(102)/period(50) = 3342/1678 = 1.992.
 207+ FA52              SFX_CountdownGo:
 208+ FA52 FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0          ; ~120ms cada step
 209+ FA56 FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 210+ FA5A FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 211+ FA5E FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 212+ FA62 FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 213+ FA66 FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 214+ FA6A FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 215+ FA6E FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 216+ FA72 5A 32 00 00      DEFB 90, 50, 0, 0           ; total ~1003ms
 217+ FA76 00               DEFB 0
