 969+ E9F5 C9           SFX_TownGate_OnFingerPulse:     RET
 970+ E9F6 C9           SFX_TownGate_OnFingerOut:       RET
 971+ E9F7 C9           SFX_TownGate_OnArmOut:          RET
 972+ E9F8 C9           SFX_TownGate_OnPlayerTurn:      RET
 973+ E9F9 C9           SFX_TownGate_OnPlayerFramed:    RET
 974+ E9FA C9           SFX_TownGate_OnPlayerExit:      RET
