1070+ EF58              ; PaintSynthPickupAttrs - Pinta attrs hardcoded del random pickup en VRAM
1071+ EF58              ; ==============================================================================
1072+ EF58              ; Se llama desde:
1073+ EF58              ;   - .pkDrawDone (DrawScreen): tras dibujar pixels del synth.
1074+ EF58              ;   - MainLoop tras RefreshPickupAttrs: para repintar attrs si un enemigo paso
1075+ EF58              ;     por encima y los borro.
1076+ EF58              ;
1077+ EF58              ; Bypass total del day/night remap → respeta exactamente el patrón per-celda
1078+ EF58              ; que el BG editor exporta (ej: col1 bright + col2 dim). Lee los 4 attrs
1079+ EF58              ; ya extraídos por LoadSynthSpriteAndExtractAttr (RandomSynthAttr=TL,
1080+ EF58              ; RandomSynthAttrTR, RandomSynthAttrBL, RandomSynthAttrBR) y los pinta
1081+ EF58              ; 1:1 en VRAM.
1082+ EF58              ;
1083+ EF58              ; Pickup es 16x16 = 2x2 char attrs.
1084+ EF58              ; Early-out si RandomSynthMapX = $FE (no activo).
1085+ EF58              ; Destruye AF, BC, DE, HL.
1086+ EF58              ; ==============================================================================
1087+ EF58              PaintSynthPickupAttrsBody:
1088+ EF58 3A B4 5F         LD A, (RandomSynthMapX)
1089+ EF5B FE FE            CP $FE
1090+ EF5D C8               RET Z                               ; no activo
1091+ EF5E                  ; --- Calcular VRAM addr fila 0 = ATTR_BASE + (charY+BG_Y_OFFSET)*32 + charX ---
1092+ EF5E 3A B9 5F         LD A, (RandomSynthCharY)
1093+ EF61 C6 02            ADD A, BG_Y_OFFSET
1094+ EF63 26 00            LD H, 0
1095+ EF65 6F               LD L, A
1096+ EF66 29               ADD HL, HL
1097+ EF67 29               ADD HL, HL
1098+ EF68 29               ADD HL, HL
1099+ EF69 29               ADD HL, HL
1100+ EF6A 29               ADD HL, HL                          ; *32
1101+ EF6B 3A B8 5F         LD A, (RandomSynthCharX)
1102+ EF6E 85               ADD A, L
1103+ EF6F 6F               LD L, A
1104+ EF70 30 01            JR NC, .pspaNoCarry
1105+ EF72 24               INC H
1106+ EF73              .pspaNoCarry:
1107+ EF73 11 00 58         LD DE, ATTR_BASE
1108+ EF76 19               ADD HL, DE                          ; HL = VRAM addr fila 0, col 0
1109+ EF77                  ; --- Fila 0: TL, TR ---
1110+ EF77 3A BB 5F         LD A, (RandomSynthAttr)             ; TL
1111+ EF7A 77               LD (HL), A
1112+ EF7B 23               INC HL
1113+ EF7C 3A E1 5F         LD A, (RandomSynthAttrTR)
1114+ EF7F 77               LD (HL), A
1115+ EF80                  ; --- Avanzar a fila 1 col 0: +32 desde col 1 → +31 ---
1116+ EF80 7D               LD A, L
1117+ EF81 C6 1F            ADD A, 31
1118+ EF83 6F               LD L, A
1119+ EF84 30 01            JR NC, .pspaNoCarry2
1120+ EF86 24               INC H
